{"id":"d5279d8362faa66f","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Reduced Cofinality","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality — ZFC Pcf4 Reduced Cofinality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality — ZFC Pcf4 Reduced Cofinality","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality — ZFC Pcf4 Reduced Cofinality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"434af3b8c053a816\" href=\"?note=434af3b8c053a816\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a32c3b00cffaa99\" href=\"?note=5a32c3b00cffaa99\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality\">58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ReducedCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ReducedCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}reduced\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ReducedCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}reduced\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ReducedCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical true-cofinality predicate supplies a proper ideal, a cofinal reduced-product chain, and regularity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>; the carrier is additionally required to be progressive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set","status":"resolved","id":"434af3b8c053a816","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-progressive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"5a32c3b00cffaa99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf3-true-cofinality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,J,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ReducedCofinality}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}reduced\\text{-}cofinality} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ReducedCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcPcf2ProgressiveSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3TrueCofinality}_S(A,J,\\lambda)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1036,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3091","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality.md|58-df-zfc-pcf4-reduced-cofinality]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["434af3b8c053a816","5a32c3b00cffaa99"]}